{"schemaVersion":1,"minAppVersion":1,"id":"expansion-001","courses":[{"id":50,"stage":10,"title":"解释自己的选择","en":"Explain a personal choice","questions":[{"id":"50-0","prompt":"选择“我选择它是因为它符合我的需求。”的英文","options":["I would reconsider if the situation changed.","I chose it because it suits my needs.","The main advantage is its simplicity."],"answer":"I chose it because it suits my needs.","explanation":"I chose it because it suits my needs.\n我选择它是因为它符合我的需求。","audio":"audio/next-000.mp3"},{"id":"50-1","prompt":"选择“它的主要优点是简单。”的英文","options":["I chose it because it suits my needs.","The main advantage is its simplicity.","I would reconsider if the situation changed."],"answer":"The main advantage is its simplicity.","explanation":"The main advantage is its simplicity.\n它的主要优点是简单。","audio":"audio/next-001.mp3"},{"id":"50-2","prompt":"选择“如果情况变化，我会重新考虑。”的英文","options":["The main advantage is its simplicity.","I would reconsider if the situation changed.","I chose it because it suits my needs."],"answer":"I would reconsider if the situation changed.","explanation":"I would reconsider if the situation changed.\n如果情况变化，我会重新考虑。","audio":"audio/next-002.mp3"},{"id":"50-listen","kind":"listen","prompt":"听一听，选择对方的意思","options":["我选择它是因为它符合我的需求。","它的主要优点是简单。","如果情况变化，我会重新考虑。"],"answer":"我选择它是因为它符合我的需求。","transcript":"I chose it because it suits my needs.","explanation":"I chose it because it suits my needs.\n我选择它是因为它符合我的需求。","audio":"audio/next-003.mp3"}],"speaking":{"task":"用自己的经历练习“解释自己的选择”，回答并追问。","sample":"I chose it because it suits my needs. The main advantage is its simplicity. I would reconsider if the situation changed."},"talk":[{"line":"What choice have you made recently?","meaning":"你最近做过什么选择？","audio":"audio/next-004.mp3"},{"line":"What mattered most when you decided?","meaning":"决定时你最看重什么？","audio":"audio/next-005.mp3"},{"line":"What might make you choose differently?","meaning":"什么可能让你做出不同选择？","audio":"audio/next-006.mp3"}]},{"id":51,"stage":10,"title":"分享一段学习经历","en":"Share a learning experience","questions":[{"id":"51-0","prompt":"选择“我以前觉得这很难。”的英文","options":["I used to find it difficult.","What helped most was practicing regularly.","I still have room for improvement."],"answer":"I used to find it difficult.","explanation":"I used to find it difficult.\n我以前觉得这很难。","audio":"audio/next-007.mp3"},{"id":"51-1","prompt":"选择“最有帮助的是定期练习。”的英文","options":["What helped most was practicing regularly.","I still have room for improvement.","I used to find it difficult."],"answer":"What helped most was practicing regularly.","explanation":"What helped most was practicing regularly.\n最有帮助的是定期练习。","audio":"audio/next-008.mp3"},{"id":"51-2","prompt":"选择“我仍有进步空间。”的英文","options":["I still have room for improvement.","I used to find it difficult.","What helped most was practicing regularly."],"answer":"I still have room for improvement.","explanation":"I still have room for improvement.\n我仍有进步空间。","audio":"audio/next-009.mp3"},{"id":"51-listen","kind":"listen","prompt":"听一听，选择对方的意思","options":["我以前觉得这很难。","最有帮助的是定期练习。","我仍有进步空间。"],"answer":"我以前觉得这很难。","transcript":"I used to find it difficult.","explanation":"I used to find it difficult.\n我以前觉得这很难。","audio":"audio/next-010.mp3"}],"speaking":{"task":"用自己的经历练习“分享一段学习经历”，回答并追问。","sample":"I used to find it difficult. What helped most was practicing regularly. I still have room for improvement."},"talk":[{"line":"Tell me about something you have learned.","meaning":"说说你学会的一件事。","audio":"audio/next-011.mp3"},{"line":"What helped you overcome the difficulties?","meaning":"什么帮你克服了困难？","audio":"audio/next-012.mp3"},{"line":"What would you do differently next time?","meaning":"下次你会有哪些不同做法？","audio":"audio/next-013.mp3"}]},{"id":52,"stage":10,"title":"讨论一篇短文","en":"Discuss a short text","questions":[{"id":"52-0","prompt":"选择“主要观点很容易理解。”的英文","options":["One detail surprised me.","I would like to know more about the evidence.","The main point is easy to understand."],"answer":"The main point is easy to understand.","explanation":"The main point is easy to understand.\n主要观点很容易理解。","audio":"audio/next-014.mp3"},{"id":"52-1","prompt":"选择“有一个细节让我惊讶。”的英文","options":["I would like to know more about the evidence.","The main point is easy to understand.","One detail surprised me."],"answer":"One detail surprised me.","explanation":"One detail surprised me.\n有一个细节让我惊讶。","audio":"audio/next-015.mp3"},{"id":"52-2","prompt":"选择“我想进一步了解证据。”的英文","options":["The main point is easy to understand.","One detail surprised me.","I would like to know more about the evidence."],"answer":"I would like to know more about the evidence.","explanation":"I would like to know more about the evidence.\n我想进一步了解证据。","audio":"audio/next-016.mp3"},{"id":"52-listen","kind":"listen","prompt":"听一听，选择对方的意思","options":["主要观点很容易理解。","有一个细节让我惊讶。","我想进一步了解证据。"],"answer":"主要观点很容易理解。","transcript":"The main point is easy to understand.","explanation":"The main point is easy to understand.\n主要观点很容易理解。","audio":"audio/next-017.mp3"}],"speaking":{"task":"用自己的经历练习“讨论一篇短文”，回答并追问。","sample":"The main point is easy to understand. One detail surprised me. I would like to know more about the evidence."},"talk":[{"line":"What was the text mainly about?","meaning":"文章主要说了什么？","audio":"audio/next-018.mp3"},{"line":"Which detail caught your attention?","meaning":"哪个细节吸引了你的注意？","audio":"audio/next-019.mp3"},{"line":"What question would you ask the author?","meaning":"你会问作者什么问题？","audio":"audio/next-020.mp3"}]},{"id":53,"stage":10,"title":"解释误会并修复对话","en":"Clear up a misunderstanding","questions":[{"id":"53-0","prompt":"选择“那不完全是我的意思。”的英文","options":["I am glad we cleared that up.","That is not quite what I meant.","Let me put it another way."],"answer":"That is not quite what I meant.","explanation":"That is not quite what I meant.\n那不完全是我的意思。","audio":"audio/next-021.mp3"},{"id":"53-1","prompt":"选择“让我换一种说法。”的英文","options":["That is not quite what I meant.","Let me put it another way.","I am glad we cleared that up."],"answer":"Let me put it another way.","explanation":"Let me put it another way.\n让我换一种说法。","audio":"audio/next-022.mp3"},{"id":"53-2","prompt":"选择“很高兴我们把那点说清楚了。”的英文","options":["Let me put it another way.","I am glad we cleared that up.","That is not quite what I meant."],"answer":"I am glad we cleared that up.","explanation":"I am glad we cleared that up.\n很高兴我们把那点说清楚了。","audio":"audio/next-023.mp3"},{"id":"53-listen","kind":"listen","prompt":"听一听，选择对方的意思","options":["那不完全是我的意思。","让我换一种说法。","很高兴我们把那点说清楚了。"],"answer":"那不完全是我的意思。","transcript":"That is not quite what I meant.","explanation":"That is not quite what I meant.\n那不完全是我的意思。","audio":"audio/next-024.mp3"}],"speaking":{"task":"用自己的经历练习“解释误会并修复对话”，回答并追问。","sample":"That is not quite what I meant. Let me put it another way. I am glad we cleared that up."},"talk":[{"line":"How would you explain that someone misunderstood you?","meaning":"你会如何说明对方误解了你？","audio":"audio/next-025.mp3"},{"line":"Could you express the same idea more simply?","meaning":"你可以把同一观点说得更简单吗？","audio":"audio/next-026.mp3"},{"line":"How would you check that you now agree?","meaning":"你会如何确认现在达成了一致？","audio":"audio/next-027.mp3"}]},{"id":54,"stage":10,"title":"综合表达与追问","en":"Develop a conversation","questions":[{"id":"54-0","prompt":"选择“我能想到几个可能的原因。”的英文","options":["I can think of a few possible reasons.","It would help to hear another perspective.","Could you tell me more about your experience?"],"answer":"I can think of a few possible reasons.","explanation":"I can think of a few possible reasons.\n我能想到几个可能的原因。","audio":"audio/next-028.mp3"},{"id":"54-1","prompt":"选择“听听另一个角度会有帮助。”的英文","options":["It would help to hear another perspective.","Could you tell me more about your experience?","I can think of a few possible reasons."],"answer":"It would help to hear another perspective.","explanation":"It would help to hear another perspective.\n听听另一个角度会有帮助。","audio":"audio/next-029.mp3"},{"id":"54-2","prompt":"选择“你可以多说说你的经历吗？”的英文","options":["Could you tell me more about your experience?","I can think of a few possible reasons.","It would help to hear another perspective."],"answer":"Could you tell me more about your experience?","explanation":"Could you tell me more about your experience?\n你可以多说说你的经历吗？","audio":"audio/next-030.mp3"},{"id":"54-listen","kind":"listen","prompt":"听一听，选择对方的意思","options":["我能想到几个可能的原因。","听听另一个角度会有帮助。","你可以多说说你的经历吗？"],"answer":"我能想到几个可能的原因。","transcript":"I can think of a few possible reasons.","explanation":"I can think of a few possible reasons.\n我能想到几个可能的原因。","audio":"audio/next-031.mp3"}],"speaking":{"task":"用自己的经历练习“综合表达与追问”，回答并追问。","sample":"I can think of a few possible reasons. It would help to hear another perspective. Could you tell me more about your experience?"},"talk":[{"line":"What topic would you like to discuss?","meaning":"你想讨论什么话题？","audio":"audio/next-032.mp3"},{"line":"Can you explain your view with an example?","meaning":"你能用一个例子解释自己的看法吗？","audio":"audio/next-033.mp3"},{"line":"What would you like to ask me next?","meaning":"接下来你想问我什么？","audio":"audio/next-034.mp3"}]}],"words":[{"id":"slam","word":"slam","meaning":"n. 砰然声, 猛然, 猛烈的抨击\nvt. 猛然关上, 砰地关上, 猛烈抨击","phonetic":"slæm","audio":"audio/next-035.mp3"},{"id":"civilization","word":"civilization","meaning":"n. 文明, 教化","phonetic":"si.vilai'zeiʃәn","audio":"audio/next-036.mp3"},{"id":"melt","word":"melt","meaning":"n. 熔化, 熔化物, 溶解\nv. (使)熔化, (使)溶解, (使)消散, (使)变软","phonetic":"melt","audio":"audio/next-037.mp3"},{"id":"midnight","word":"midnight","meaning":"n. 午夜, 子夜, 半夜\na. 午夜的, 半夜的","phonetic":"'midnait","audio":"audio/next-038.mp3"},{"id":"curve","word":"curve","meaning":"n. 曲线, 弯曲, 曲线球\nvt. 弯, 使弯曲","phonetic":"kә:v","audio":"audio/next-039.mp3"},{"id":"integrity","word":"integrity","meaning":"n. 正直, 廉正, 完整","phonetic":"in'tegriti","audio":"audio/next-040.mp3"},{"id":"entitle","word":"entitle","meaning":"vt. 给...权利, 取名为, 给予名称, 叫做","phonetic":"in'taitl","audio":"audio/next-041.mp3"},{"id":"evident","word":"evident","meani